<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32585" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπειρ-άομαι</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεπειράθην <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱ]</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make trial of, prove,
			tempt,</i> c. gen. pers., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.135
			</span></i> : c. inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπειρᾷ
				λέγειν</span>; <i>art</i> thou <i>tempting</i> me to
			speak? <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				360
			</span></i> codd. : folld. by a relat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἀξεπειράθην..οἷον στέρεσθαι γίγνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					1089
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. εἴτε..</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					362e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>inquire, ask of another,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					1234
				</span></i>
			.—Late in 
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				7.19
			</span></i>.</div>
